    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80bc4afe21b6b5e3412c1cc2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈——哈哈，亲爱的子民们，\n感谢诸位！\n世纪末forever！",
      "source_fingerprint": "caf69b1f6b670e0f3cc1cd42caf64700dc5976342c5295820a47d3654428761f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077332.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f599ae78c03f740f618a2bbc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利者是好歌剧。\n虽然她并非绝对的王者，\n但是作为引领者的地位却是从未被动摇过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4fb4e6b5ef31b375da305230dd337d9388f5a8098e4ebbab1beba7157d97da4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077332.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:018052d9f3d43efb97789a29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样比赛结束后，\n四人一起聚集在地下通道中――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e42ca6c56358903ad6aa2195e3888ecf834690d958b3bc4636dba711358f5b47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077332.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a818466013315606438f4171",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本杯之后·世纪末的涅槃",
